    "reviews": "\u201cSail the cosmically coloured waters, take in the sights and the sounds.\u201d<br>Rock Paper Shotgun<br><br>\u201cI felt nostalgic for a place I had never visited, a deep longing for an experience I had never had. I felt at home in something completely unfamiliar\u201d<br>Vice<br><br>\u201cEveryone would benefit from five minutes of gentle drifting. Sometimes you don\u2019t need a destination\u201d<br>Cultured Vultures<br>",
